12+{\\int }_{2}^{T}(3-\\sqrt{t-2})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =12+{(3t-\\frac{2}{3}{(t-2)}^{3/2})|}_{2}^{T} \\\\  & =12+3T-\\frac{2}{3}(T-2)^{3/2}-(3(2)-\\frac{2}{3}(2-2)^{3/2}) \\\\  & =6+3T-\\frac{2}{3}(T-2)^{3/2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, let's rewrite our final answer in terms of our original variable $t.$ We have\n\n$$\nF(t)=6+3t-\\frac{2}{3}(t-2)^{3/2},\\,t\\ge 2.\n$$" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306013 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306014 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306015 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306016 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1000 #edb/ref 17592186306017 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1041 "selection" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1104 #edb/ref 17592186306015 13194139534727 true] [17592186306012 1110 #uuid "f453d496-09d8-518c-a100-b1c1996a6c65" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306013 1034 "F(t)=6t+\\frac{1}{3}(t-2)^{3/2}" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306013 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534727 true] [17592186306013 1111 #uuid "de1badbd-5bff-539e-9133-3f907f666417" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306014 1034 "F(t)=9t-\\frac{2}{3}(t-2)^{5/2}" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306014 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534727 true] [17592186306014 1111 #uuid "7780cd54-6ca4-5d8a-8b64-8af5cfb677d8" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306015 1034 "F(t)=6+3t-\\frac{2}{3}(t-2)^{3/2}" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306015 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534727 true] [17592186306015 1111 #uuid "69173b6a-f9ee-5ca2-bafd-167452f321c7" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306016 1034 "F(t)=3t-\\frac{1}{3}(t-2)^{3/2}" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306016 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534727 true] [17592186306016 1111 #uuid "9c04e6cc-f466-5c34-aae8-c335a78f23bb" 13194139534727 true] [17592186306017 1034 "F(t)=6t+\\frac{2}{3}{t}^{3/2}" 13194139534727 true] [175921